0..80 Comment "// A lambda\'s parameter written with its type, `fun (x : A) { … }`, is read at"
81..154 Comment "// `A`: the argument the lambda binds is returned at `A` and bound as the"
155..218 Comment "// parameter, so the arrow the lambda answers must take an `A`."
